  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop tomato and garlic.<br>• Roughly chop brown onion. Drain and rinse lentils.<br>• In a small bowl, combine tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c0bbcdfd65d69c3001d/step-a9df1900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave garlic and 1/2 the butter in 10 second bursts until melted.<br>• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on a lined oven tray.<br>• Brush with garlic butter, then season. Toss to coat.<br>• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c0bbcdfd65d69c3001d/step-a7cbad10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins. Add lentils and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins.<br>• Stir in All-American spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Stir in the water, BBQ sauce, stock powder and remaining butter, then simmer until wilted, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c0bbcdfd65d69c3001d/step-1089df20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide tortilla chips between plates.<br>• Top with smokey lentil mixture and light sour cream. Spoon over zingy tomato and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c0bbcdfd65d69c3001d/step-5a5f6c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
